.TH i.band.library 1 "" "GRASS 8.4.1" "GRASS GIS User's Manual"
.SH NAME
\fI\fBi.band.library.py\fR\fR  \- Prints available semantic label information used for multispectral data.
.SH KEYWORDS
general, imagery, semantic label, image collections
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBi.band.library.py\fR
.br
\fBi.band.library.py \-\-help\fR
.br
\fBi.band.library.py\fR [\-\fBe\fR]  [\fBpattern\fR=\fIstring\fR]   [\fBoperation\fR=\fIstring\fR]   [\-\-\fBhelp\fR]  [\-\-\fBverbose\fR]  [\-\-\fBquiet\fR]  [\-\-\fBui\fR]
.SS Flags:
.IP "\fB\-e\fR" 4m
.br
Print extended metadata information
.IP "\fB\-\-help\fR" 4m
.br
Print usage summary
.IP "\fB\-\-verbose\fR" 4m
.br
Verbose module output
.IP "\fB\-\-quiet\fR" 4m
.br
Quiet module output
.IP "\fB\-\-ui\fR" 4m
.br
Force launching GUI dialog
.SS Parameters:
.IP "\fBpattern\fR=\fIstring\fR" 4m
.br
Semantic label search pattern (examples: L, S2, .*_2, S2_1)
.IP "\fBoperation\fR=\fIstring\fR" 4m
.br
Operation to be performed
.br
Options: \fIprint\fR
.br
Default: \fIprint\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fIi.band.library\fR prints available band information of multispectral data
defined by GRASS GIS. The following multispectral sensors are supported
by default (other band reference registry files can be added, see below):
.PP
